  <item>
    <title>017 📚 《世上为什么要有图书馆》：她没有标准答案，只埋头编排书单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ba7dab606e5c5940328e65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ba7dab606e5c5940328e65</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Feb 2025 01:49:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkZ08cJbnSDQCT-l4P0CI-eSdJ1Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><u><strong><span>本期导航：</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2">00:02</a> 简单介绍这本书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 简单介绍上海译文出版社《译文纪实》系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 豆瓣上有关这本书的一些差评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 这本书的主要内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 书名是这么多差评的罪魁祸首</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">05:41</a> 教科书上的标准回答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> DeepSeek的量子解答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> DeepSeek“说人话”的回复</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 逆向思考：其实世上不一定需要图书馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 宏观尺度：五大功能都逐渐过期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 微观尺度：建设“这一座”图书馆只是为了达标需要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 问题越来越多，差评在所难免</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 我为什么给这本书打出四星好评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 关于“世上为什么要有图书馆”，我的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> 答案之一：相信书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 答案之二：相信理想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> 答案之三：相信行动的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 标准的项目管理全流程示范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 文科生作者为什么能精通项目管理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 原书选读：如何通过阅读获得精神自由</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6738c564c155ab5083c6f0f7/lrT2P8a7W93dWGg8B-C8TFN1VEoU.m4a" length="20188767" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:36</itunes:duration>
