  <item>
    <title>013 📚 《六星纪元》：科幻+武侠+悬疑+动漫+电竞 =？40岁玫瑰叔的少年心气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6796337a247d51713c6aa69a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6796337a247d51713c6aa69a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jan 2025 13:09:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuPADBWbWJLHp1PXSY-YlMQOktKu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 《六星纪元：盟战时代》故事简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 作者“玫瑰叔”个人简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> 科幻只是皮肤，内核是流行文化大杂糅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> 致敬《沙丘》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 致敬《冰与火之歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> 致敬《三体》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 致敬金庸《连城诀》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 致敬《哈利-波特》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 为什么这样的致敬是可取的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 这本《六星纪元》的第1个可取之处：架空宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 第2个可取之处：观察样本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> 第3个可取之处：少年心气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 玫瑰叔自述创作过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 玫瑰叔自评本书的4个不足</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 为什么这些所谓“不足”都无伤大雅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 这本书应该能衍生出一个系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 需要读第二遍才能意识到的细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> 非常有趣的姓名设定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 为什么我给这本书打4星</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6738c564c155ab5083c6f0f7/lkLvJCdtM4lJmnsd3VTjy8gGgI2t.m4a" length="41021126" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr5QA3FNUXGtnTC0OwyZ2HitYx_y.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
