  <item>
    <title>012 📚 《火星救援》与《挽救计划》：一个宇宙做题家的自我修养</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678b01b9fd38652366da1af7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678b01b9fd38652366da1af7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jan 2025 01:23:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 豆瓣评分8.9分的《火星救援》，我为什么只打三颗星？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 好的科幻小说，标准是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 与其说它是科幻小说，倒不如说它更像是推理小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 整个故事完全由一个 idea 驱动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 什么样的读者会喜欢这样的写法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 本质上是《鲁滨逊漂流记》的现代版 remix</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 刻意植入的中国太空局元素，与近期的小红书难民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 小小地 Cue 了一下《少年Pi的奇幻漂流》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 这本书“屎尿屁齐飞”的语言风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 这本书的三个可取之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 接着聊聊作者的另一部作品《挽救计划》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 换汤不换药的同一个主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 开篇设定有点像《谍影重重》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 一个宇宙做题家的自我修养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> “噬星体”病毒概念的现实映照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 向 Beatles 及流行文化的致敬</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6738c564c155ab5083c6f0f7/luejJCJvKksctofD24JtDjZikwSJ.m4a" length="9548907" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:13:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncaZD_BK-QFVm0icsghn3y2CHsl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>011 📚 《具体生活》：未经检视的生活不值得过，可是P人怎么办？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678680c4f787119b3d3c1803</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678680c4f787119b3d3c1803</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jan 2025 15:25:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 简单介绍这本《具体生活》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> “未经检视的生活不值得过”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> “检视生活”的几个实操案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> “何为美好生活”的两种想象模板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 对“贵族生活”的一种误解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 吴军老师对“美好生活”的具体定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 吴军老师的7种美好事物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 为什么必须用理性指导生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 不求甚解 vs 要求甚解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> J型人的典型特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 简单介绍下吴军老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 吴军老师的代表作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 为什么这本《具体生活》的豆瓣评分只有7.6分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 为什么我觉得这些批评有失偏颇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 这本《具体生活》给我的最大启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 如此“具体生活”，让P型人情何以堪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 高明的人能兼容两套以上操作系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 吴军给高中生开出的一份书单，以及为什么要读金庸、琼瑶</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6738c564c155ab5083c6f0f7/lsvI5edDMTbCm_ZHAYtTmFyOjimv.m4a" length="13780873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fka1DY1ukRUsWOTCeCDJxdaZeNS4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>010 📚 《夜谭十记》：在四川一定要读这本书，让人想到鲁迅、《活着》和《官场现形记》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678517e9d6a4b57e14d6fce1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678517e9d6a4b57e14d6fce1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 13:47:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 为什么想到读这本《夜谭十记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 这本书的架空设计，有点像薄伽丘的《十日谈》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 开篇又有一点《红楼梦》的古典味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> 印象深刻的故事之一：《观花记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 印象深刻的故事之二：《生儿记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 印象深刻的故事之三：《买牛记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 怎堪命运捉弄，神似余华《活着》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 我给这本书打3.5分的三个理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 为什么即便如此，我还是很喜欢这本书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 与《张医生和王医生》的对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 四川方言的特色表达（由我家领导示范）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 印象深刻的故事之四：《亲仇记》，神似《盗梦空间》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 印象深刻的故事之五：《踢踏记》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6738c564c155ab5083c6f0f7/ljKzCPey_lnQVRTIZF26wcqbJZ9y.m4a" length="15185370" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:47</itunes:duration>
